@startuml
title Vue Component & Connector (C&C) — Architecture Hexagonale BrokerX

/'
**Type de diagramme**: Component & Connector (C&C) — Vue architecturale
Montre le style architectural Hexagonal (Ports & Adapters) avec UC-01 à UC-05

Pour les vues 4+1 conformes à Kruchten, voir:
- logique.puml (Vue Logique - domaine)
- deploiement.puml (Vue Déploiement - infrastructure)
- developpement.puml (Vue Développement - packages)
'/

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 80
skinparam ranksep 100

' Acteurs
actor Client as client
actor "k6 Load Test" as k6

note right of client
  **Endpoints disponibles:**
  POST /api/v1/signup
  POST /api/v1/login
  POST /api/v1/deposits
  POST /api/v1/market-data/subscribe
  GET /ws (WebSocket)
  POST /api/v1/orders
  GET /api/v1/orders/{id}
  DELETE /api/v1/orders/{id}
end note

note right of k6
  **Tests de charge sur:**
  - UC-01 (Signup)
  - UC-02 (Auth)
  - UC-03 (Deposits)
end note

' =======================
'   LAYER 1: ADAPTERS ENTRANTS (Web/API)
' =======================
package "Adapters entrants (Controllers)" <<Rectangle>> {
  ' UC-01, UC-02, UC-03 (existants)
  component "[UC-01]\nSignupController" as SignupCtrl #D3E5FF
  component "[UC-02]\nAuthController" as AuthCtrl #F3E5F5
  component "[UC-03]\nWalletController" as WalletCtrl #FFF3E0
  
  ' UC-04, UC-05 (nouveaux)
  component "[UC-04]\nMarketDataController\n+ WebSocket Hub" as MarketCtrl #FCE4EC
  component "[UC-05]\nOrdersController" as OrdersCtrl #F1F8E9
  
  component "PaymentWebhookController" as WebhookCtrl #E0E0E0
}

' =======================
'   LAYER 2: PORTS ENTRANTS (Interfaces Application)
' =======================
package "Ports entrants (Interfaces Use Cases)" <<Rectangle>> {
  interface ISignupUseCase <<UC-01>>
  interface IAuthUseCase <<UC-02>>
  interface IDepositUseCase <<UC-03>>
  interface ISettlementCallbackUseCase <<UC-03>>
  interface IMarketDataUseCase <<UC-04>>
  interface IOrderUseCase <<UC-05>>
}

' =======================
'   LAYER 3: APPLICATION SERVICES
' =======================
package "Application Layer (Services)" <<Rectangle>> {
  component "SignupService" as SignupSvc #D3E5FF
  component "AuthService" as AuthSvc #F3E5F5
  component "WalletService" as WalletSvc #FFF3E0
  component "MarketDataService" as MarketSvc #FCE4EC
  component "OrderService" as OrderSvc #F1F8E9
}

' =======================
'   LAYER 4: DOMAINE (Entités/Règles métier)
' =======================
package "Domaine (Entités & Règles métier)" <<Rectangle>> {
  component "Client\nCompte\nDossierKYC\nVerifContactOTP" as IdentityDomain #D3E5FF
  component "Session\nPolitiqueMFA\nDefiMFA" as SecurityDomain #F3E5F5
  component "Portefeuille\nPayTx\nLedger" as WalletDomain #FFF3E0
  component "Quote\nSubscription" as MarketDataDomain #FCE4EC
  component "Ordre\nExecution\nPosition" as TradingDomain #F1F8E9
  component "AuditLog" as AuditDomain #EDE7F6
}

' =======================
'   LAYER 5: PORTS SORTANTS (Interfaces Infrastructure)
' =======================
package "Ports sortants (Interfaces Infrastructure)" <<Rectangle>> {
  ' Repositories
  interface IClientRepository
  interface IAccountRepository
  interface IPortfolioRepository
  interface IPayTxRepository
  interface IOrderRepository
  interface IPositionRepository
  interface IQuoteRepository
  interface ISubscriptionRepository
  
  ' External services
  interface IOtpPort
  interface IKycPort
  interface IPaymentPort
  interface IMarketFeedPort
  
  ' Infrastructure
  interface ISessionPort
  interface IAuditPort
  interface ILedgerPort
}

' =======================
'   LAYER 6: ADAPTERS SORTANTS (Implémentations)
' =======================
package "Adapters sortants (Infrastructure)" <<Rectangle>> {
  ' EF Core Repositories
  component "EfClientRepository" as EfClient
  component "EfAccountRepository" as EfAccount
  component "EfPortfolioRepository" as EfPortfolio
  component "EfPayTxRepository" as EfPayTx
  component "EfOrderRepository" as EfOrder
  component "EfPositionRepository" as EfPosition
  component "EfQuoteRepository" as EfQuote
  component "EfSubscriptionRepository" as EfSubscription
  
  ' External adapters
  component "EmailSmsOtpAdapter" as OtpAdapter
  component "KycAdapterSim" as KycAdapter
  component "PaymentAdapterSim" as PayAdapter
  component "MarketFeedSimAdapter" as MarketAdapter
  
  ' Infrastructure adapters
  component "JwtSessionAdapter" as JwtAdapter
  component "StructuredAuditAdapter" as AuditAdapter
  component "SqlLedgerAdapter" as LedgerAdapter
}

' =======================
'   LAYER 7: SYSTÈMES EXTERNES SIMULÉS
' =======================
package "Simulateurs (Docker local)" <<Rectangle>> {
  component "otp-sim" as OtpSim
  component "kyc-sim" as KycSim
  component "pay-sim" as PaySim
  component "market-feed-sim" as MarketSim
}

' =======================
'   CONNEXIONS: Client & k6 → Controllers (groupées)
' =======================
client -down-> SignupCtrl
client -down-> MarketCtrl
k6 -down-> AuthCtrl

note on link
  Client utilise tous les controllers
  k6 teste UC-01, UC-02, UC-03
end note

' =======================
'   CONNEXIONS: Controllers → Ports entrants
' =======================
SignupCtrl -down-> ISignupUseCase
AuthCtrl -down-> IAuthUseCase
WalletCtrl -down-> IDepositUseCase
WebhookCtrl -down-> ISettlementCallbackUseCase
MarketCtrl -down-> IMarketDataUseCase
OrdersCtrl -down-> IOrderUseCase

' =======================
'   CONNEXIONS: Services implémentent Ports entrants
' =======================
SignupSvc .up.|> ISignupUseCase
AuthSvc .up.|> IAuthUseCase
WalletSvc .up.|> IDepositUseCase
WalletSvc .up.|> ISettlementCallbackUseCase
MarketSvc .up.|> IMarketDataUseCase
OrderSvc .up.|> IOrderUseCase

' =======================
'   CONNEXIONS: Services → Domaine
' =======================
SignupSvc -down-> IdentityDomain
AuthSvc -down-> SecurityDomain
WalletSvc -down-> WalletDomain
MarketSvc -down-> MarketDataDomain
OrderSvc -down-> TradingDomain
OrderSvc -down-> WalletDomain : (Ledger pour trades)

SignupSvc -down-> AuditDomain
AuthSvc -down-> AuditDomain
WalletSvc -down-> AuditDomain
OrderSvc -down-> AuditDomain

' =======================
'   CONNEXIONS: Services → Ports sortants (Repos)
' =======================
SignupSvc -down-> IClientRepository
SignupSvc -down-> IAccountRepository
AuthSvc -down-> IClientRepository
WalletSvc -down-> IPortfolioRepository
WalletSvc -down-> IPayTxRepository
MarketSvc -down-> IQuoteRepository
MarketSvc -down-> ISubscriptionRepository
OrderSvc -down-> IOrderRepository
OrderSvc -down-> IPositionRepository
OrderSvc -down-> IQuoteRepository : (prix actuels)

' =======================
'   CONNEXIONS: Services → Ports sortants (External)
' =======================
SignupSvc -down-> IOtpPort
SignupSvc -down-> IKycPort
AuthSvc -down-> IOtpPort
WalletSvc -down-> IPaymentPort
MarketSvc -down-> IMarketFeedPort

' =======================
'   CONNEXIONS: Services → Ports sortants (Infra)
' =======================
SignupSvc -down-> IAuditPort
AuthSvc -down-> IAuditPort
AuthSvc -down-> ISessionPort
WalletSvc -down-> IAuditPort
WalletSvc -down-> ILedgerPort
OrderSvc -down-> IAuditPort
OrderSvc -down-> ILedgerPort

' =======================
'   CONNEXIONS: Adapters implémentent Ports sortants
' =======================
EfClient .up.|> IClientRepository
EfAccount .up.|> IAccountRepository
EfPortfolio .up.|> IPortfolioRepository
EfPayTx .up.|> IPayTxRepository
EfOrder .up.|> IOrderRepository
EfPosition .up.|> IPositionRepository
EfQuote .up.|> IQuoteRepository
EfSubscription .up.|> ISubscriptionRepository

OtpAdapter .up.|> IOtpPort
KycAdapter .up.|> IKycPort
PayAdapter .up.|> IPaymentPort
MarketAdapter .up.|> IMarketFeedPort

JwtAdapter .up.|> ISessionPort
AuditAdapter .up.|> IAuditPort
LedgerAdapter .up.|> ILedgerPort

' =======================
'   CONNEXIONS: Adapters → Simulateurs
' =======================
OtpAdapter -down-> OtpSim : HTTP
KycAdapter -down-> KycSim : HTTP
PayAdapter -down-> PaySim : HTTP
MarketAdapter -down-> MarketSim : WebSocket

' Webhook callback
PaySim -up-> WebhookCtrl : POST /payment/webhook

' =======================
'   LÉGENDE
' =======================
legend right
  **Type**: Component & Connector (C&C) — Style Architectural Hexagonal
  
  **Flux de dépendances** (de haut en bas):
    Client → Controllers (Adapters entrants)
           → Ports entrants (Interfaces UC)
           → Services Application (orchestration)
           → Domaine (règles métier pures)
           → Ports sortants (Interfaces infra)
           → Adapters sortants (implémentations)
           → Systèmes externes (simulés)
  
  **Principe clé**: Le Domaine ne dépend de RIEN
    - Pas de référence à EF Core, ASP.NET, HTTP, etc.
    - Toutes les dépendances pointent VERS le domaine
    - Inversion de dépendances via ports sortants
  
  **Use Cases implémentés**:
     UC-01 (Signup): SignupController → SignupService → Identity Domain
     UC-02 (Auth): AuthController → AuthService → Security Domain
     UC-03 (Deposits): WalletController → WalletService → Wallet Domain
     UC-04 (Market Data): MarketDataController → MarketDataService → MarketData Domain
     UC-05 (Orders): OrdersController → OrderService → Trading Domain
 
  
  **Communication inter-services** (si microservices):
    OrderService → MarketDataService (HTTP) pour obtenir prix actuels
  

end legend

@enduml
